All eleven cases from `TASK-260715-vtot05_independent-rereview-02-results.md` now reject for the intended reason: Swift `String(contentsOf:)`; Objective-C `NSData` URL loading; C/C++ libcurl; C `system`, `popen`, and `posix_spawn`; aliased Go `net/http` and `os/exec`; and `.cxx`/`.hpp` source kinds. Additional checks reject hidden and nested forbidden sources, uppercase/unknown extensions as unclassified, symlinks, FIFO/non-regular entries, Go dot/blank imports, and partial/reordered runtime policy. Explicit local `URL(fileURLWithPath:)` reads remain accepted.

